  "notes": "Constant velocity at a fixed 3 m/s target (PADDOCK_CV_SPEED_M_S=3, this PR's 1fdc799), straight ahead, on all 220 Bench2Drive routes, 13 Nov 2026, at fastcode-shakaal (one RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, shared with other users' jobs), six lanes (sites b2dcv-lane0..5-fastcode-shakaal), eight routes a run. Bench2Drive 7ec25d1 + patches 0001-0003, no early stop (Bench2Drive's own end conditions), up to three attempts a route: an attempt the leaderboard ended as a simulation or agent crash was set aside and the route driven again. Bench2Drive routes start at rest, so the floor holds a fixed target there rather than the speed it has; 3 m/s is the speed of its 50-route cell. No model: the policy is a function of one scalar. 31 of 31 source runs kept no run.json, so their routes are attributed to constant_velocity on the tree they were found in; config.model_env and the rest of config are what 31/31 source runs recorded.",
